<title>USA: Oppenheimer liquidates Spreckels stake.</title>
<headline>Oppenheimer liquidates Spreckels stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer and Co Inc, a unit of Oppenheimer Group Inc said Tuesday it liquidated its 7.7 percent stake in Spreckels Industries Inc or 459,920 Class A common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Oppenheimer said it sold the stake on August 26 for $23.6318 per share.</p>
<p>SHares were trading at 23-1/2 Tuesday morning, unchanged.</p>
